{"id":"vod_bf_27412","vodId":"27412","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"亲吻姐姐OVA","name_cn":"亲吻姐姐OVA","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至OAD10","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-28/ed3feeead324a8760d6ac7295b6824d0.jpg"},"summary":"住之江圭太是个临近高中升学考试的初中三年级男生。他在小时候由于父亲再婚，而和可爱的双胞胎姐妹·亚香和理香成为了姐弟。尽管没有血缘关系，三人也关系和睦地一同成长，但不知从何时开始，亚香和理香却似乎对圭太产生了恋情。看似是个认真的人、实际上是闷骚类型的亚香，以及虽然说话很冷淡、内在却很积极的理香。被两人所逼近的圭太，陷入了并非是由于应考学习所导致的、另一种意义上的困境。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 20:19:29","playable":true,"episodeCount":10,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"OAD01","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/qinwenjiejieOVA/OAD01/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OAD02","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/qinwenjiejieOVA/OAD02/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OAD03","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/qinwenjiejieOVA/OAD03/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OAD04","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/qinwenjiejieOVA/OAD04/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OAD05","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/qinwenjiejieOVA/OAD05/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OAD06","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/qinwenjiejieOVA/OAD06/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OAD07","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/qinwenjiejieOVA/OAD07/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OAD08","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/qinwenjiejieOVA/OAD08/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OAD09","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/qinwenjiejieOVA/OAD09/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OAD10","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/qinwenjiejieOVA/OAD10/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:20.503Z"}